# Byte-exact files.
#
# The vendored STEP engine (web/vendor/occt/) is third-party, is verified by hash in
# tests/step.test.js, and its glue/licence files legitimately contain CRLF. Git's
# line-ending normalization rewrites them on checkout (measured: the glue came back
# 96871 -> 96852 bytes, the licence 27030 -> 26526), which would break the pin for
# everyone else and alter a licence file. `-text` disables the conversion, `-diff`
# stops git from treating it as text at all.
web/vendor/occt/* -text -diff

# STL fixtures are binary model files; never touch them.
*.stl -text -diff
